    "title": "Senior Human Resources Product Owner",
    "targetLevel": "Executive Director",
    "summary": "Own the internal HR technology products behind our payments company: HRIS (Workday or SAP SuccessFactors style), recruiting/ATS, onboarding, performance management, compensation, and employee self-service. Senior product owners own the backlog and roadmap, turn HR stakeholder and employee needs into requirements for agile engineering teams, manage vendor/SaaS integrations, protect sensitive employee data under privacy and compliance rules, and mentor other product owners and analysts.\n",
